# Essence Channeler's "you" is its controller now (CR 109.5), and its static ability is judged again whenever the layers apply
# (CR 611.3a), so control changing mid-turn takes the abilities away and gives them back. Bot1 pays 1 life for Marsh Flats, so
# its Channeler has flying and vigilance. Bot2 aims Lightning Bolt at Bot1; Bot1 answers with Sudden Substitution, exchanging
# control of the Bolt and the Channeler, and points the Bolt at Bot2. With the Bolt still on the stack, Bot2 controls the
# Channeler and has lost no life this turn: no flying, no vigilance. The Bolt resolves, Bot2 loses 3 life, and Bot2's Channeler
# has both again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Plains
Essence Channeler
Black Lotus
Marsh Flats
Sudden Substitution
Island
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
